@startuml High_Level_Architecture

skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Single Docker Container" {

    [FastAPI REST Controller] as API
    [InMemory Event Queue (asyncio.Queue)] as StreamQueue
    
    package "Core Domain & Use Cases" {
        [Trade Service (Validation Engine)] as TradeService
        [Trade Expiration Job (APScheduler)] as ExpireJob
    }
    
    package "Adapters & Storage" {
        [SQLite DB Adapter (SQLAlchemy ORM)] as SQLRepo
        [In-Memory State Cache (Key-Value)] as Cache
    }
    
    database "SQLite Engine (trade_store.db)" as SQLite
}

Client --> API : HTTP POST /api/v1/trades
Client --> StreamQueue : HTTP POST /api/v1/trades/stream (Async Ingest)

StreamQueue --> TradeService : Consume Trade Event
API --> TradeService : Direct Trade Ingestion

TradeService --> Cache : O(1) Version State Lookup
TradeService --> SQLRepo : Persist / Replace Validated Trade
ExpireJob --> SQLRepo : Bulk Expire Matured Trades

SQLRepo --> SQLite : Async SQL Execution

@enduml
